description	"Boba Fett

No disintegrations.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- EE-3 Carbine Rifle (3)
- FWG-5 Flechette Pistol (Shotgun 2)
-- Fires focused blasts while hovering
-- 10% less FP damage
-- 40% slower mag reload
-- Primary fire only
- 5 Wrist Rockets (Rocket Launcher)
-- Staggers/pushes on det
-- 10% more velocity
-- 40% slower reload
- 1 Sonic Detonator
- 2 Frag Grenades

^8Attributes:
- 10% less knockback taken
- Beskar (2)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (2)
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack
-- Rocket ^3[CS1]
- Wrist Flamethrower ^3[CS2]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS3]

The infamous bounty hunter, Boba Fett."